<h1>Privacy Policy for AMBER VPN</h1>
<p class="updated">Last updated: August 14, 2026</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy describes how AMBER VPN ("we", "our", "the app") collects, uses, and discloses information when you use our Android application.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Connection data:</strong> server selection, connection status, and session duration, used to provide and maintain VPN service.</li>
  <li><strong>Device information:</strong> device model, OS version, and app version, used for compatibility and troubleshooting.</li>
  <li><strong>Advertising identifiers:</strong> used by our advertising partners to serve and measure ads (see "Advertising" below).</li>
  <li><strong>Crash and diagnostic data:</strong> collected via Firebase to help us identify and fix bugs.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not log your browsing activity, DNS queries, or traffic content while connected to the VPN.</p>

<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>This app displays ads served through Google AdMob, which may use mediated ad networks including Unity Ads. These partners may collect and use device identifiers and other data to serve personalized or non-personalized ads, subject to your consent choices presented in-app. You can manage or withdraw consent at any time from the in-app privacy settings.</p>
<p>For more on how Google's advertising products handle data, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank">Google's Partner Sites policy</a>.</p>

<h2>Data Sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal data. We share limited data with:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Google AdMob and its mediation partners (including Unity Ads), for advertising purposes.</li>
  <li>Google Firebase, for crash reporting, analytics, and push notifications.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Retention</h2>
<p>Connection logs and diagnostic data are retained only as long as necessary to operate and improve the service, and are not retained longer than 90 days unless required for security or legal purposes.</p>

<h2>Your Choices</h2>
<ul>
  <li>You can withdraw advertising consent at any time via the in-app consent management screen.</li>
  <li>You can uninstall the app at any time to stop all data collection.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>This app is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at: <strong>noelrubios1201@gmail.com</strong></p>

